subject: fix(voices): add 10s fetch timeout to voice listing (GAP-P2-19)

Prevent hung upstream providers from blocking the voice selection UI
indefinitely. Adds AbortSignal.timeout(10000) to the fetch call in
src/app/api/v1/audio/voices/route.js:35, matching the existing pattern
used in tunnel health checks.

Tests: 3 vitest unit tests including anti-false-positive assertion.

